{"id":"01b0d9585d869505b4c3ab8d609f4c4b8a726e8a","url":"https://lokutor.com/","title":"Lokutor | Voice agents that run on CPUs","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"lokutor.com","byline":"Lokutor","excerpt":"Turn-taking, noise suppression and speech synthesis built for commodity CPUs. No GPUs. Deploy in your cloud, on-prem, or on the device.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV> <!-- HERO --> <div id=\"top\"> <p><span>Programs &amp; partners</span> <a href=\"/blog/selected-for-bsc-ai-factory\"><img src=\"/bsc_logo.png\" alt=\"Barcelona Supercomputing Center AI Factory\"></a> <a href=\"/blog/nvidia-inception-program\"><img src=\"/nvidia-inception.svg\" alt=\"NVIDIA Inception\"></a> <img src=\"/aws.svg\" alt=\"AWS\"> <img src=\"/madrid-innovation.png\" alt=\"Madrid Innovation\"> </p>  <p>Turn-taking, noise suppression and speech synthesis built for ordinary processors. No GPUs. Runs in your cloud, on-prem, or on the device.</p>  <div data-hero-demo=\"\" data-api-key=\"sk-internal-123\">  <div>   <div data-panel=\"stt\"> <p data-stt-out=\"\"><span>Press the mic and talk. Words appear as you speak.</span></p> <p> <span data-stt-meta=\"\">Tap to start</span> </p> </div> <div data-panel=\"noise\"> <p><label data-hd-noise-drop=\"\" for=\"hd-noise-file\">   <span>Drop a WAV file, or <span>browse</span></span> <span>16-bit WAV · any sample rate · runs on CPU</span> </label></p> </div> </div> <p data-note=\"\">Pick a voice and a language, then just talk. No sign-up.</p>  </div>   </div> <!-- NUMBERS --> <div data-stats=\"\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"> <p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"></span><span data-to=\"0\" data-decimals=\"0\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">0</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">GPUs</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">in the whole pipeline</span> </p><p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">≈</span><span data-to=\"120\" data-decimals=\"0\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">120</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">ms</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">first audio, streaming mode</span> </p><p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">≈</span><span data-to=\"0.9\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">0.9</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">s</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">to first reply, ≈1.3 s with turn detection</span> </p><p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"></span><span data-to=\"33\" data-decimals=\"0\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">33</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">languages</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">10 voices, visemes included</span> </p> </div> <!-- PIPELINE --> <div id=\"how\"> <p><span>01 · The pipeline</span></p><h2>Five stages. Four are ours.</h2> <p>Audio goes in on the left and comes back as a voice on the right. Everything except the language model is our own CPU model.</p> <div data-pipeline=\"\" aria-label=\"Pipeline: noisy audio into Psst, clean audio into Turno, turns into Conv, text into your LLM, text into Versa, voice out\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">  <ol data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <li data-i=\"0\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Psst</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Noise suppression</span> </li><li data-i=\"1\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Turno</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Turn-taking</span> </li><li data-i=\"2\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Conv</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Speech-to-text</span> </li><li data-i=\"3\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">LLM</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Your provider</span> </li><li data-i=\"4\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Versa</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Speech synthesis</span> </li> </ol> </div>   <p>About 0.9 s to the first word of the reply on one 4-vCPU node · <a href=\"/benchmarks\">See where the time goes </a></p> </div> <!-- TURN-TAKING --> <div id=\"turno\"> <p><span>02 · Turn-taking</span></p><h2>Turno decides whose turn it is.</h2> <p>The turn passes on what it hears, not on a silence timer. A “mhm” doesn’t take it. A real interruption does.</p>  </div> <!-- NOISE --> <div id=\"psst\"> <p><span>03 · Noise</span></p><h2>Psst hears the voice, not the room.</h2> <p>The same two seconds of speech, drawn from the real audio. Drag the line to compare, or press play and watch it move.</p>    </div> <!-- WHERE IT RUNS --> <div id=\"deploy\"> <p><span>04 · Where it runs</span></p><h2>Same models. Three places.</h2> <p>Because nothing needs an accelerator, the pipeline goes wherever the CPU is.</p>  </div> <!-- HEAR IT --> <div id=\"hear\"> <p><span>05 · The voice</span></p><h2>Hear voices.</h2>  <div id=\"lp-player\" data-active=\"0\"> <div data-index=\"0\"> <p><span>instructive tone</span></p><p> <span data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"0.34\"> Okay,</span><span data-start=\"0.52\" data-end=\"0.72\"> let's</span><span data-start=\"0.72\" data-end=\"0.9\"> walk</span><span data-start=\"0.9\" data-end=\"1.14\"> through</span><span data-start=\"1.14\" data-end=\"1.28\"> the</span><span data-start=\"1.28\" data-end=\"1.44\"> new</span><span data-start=\"1.44\" data-end=\"1.84\"> dashboard</span><span data-start=\"1.84\" data-end=\"2.32\"> interface</span><span data-start=\"2.32\" data-end=\"2.92\"> together.</span><span data-start=\"3.36\" data-end=\"4.14\"> Whenever</span><span data-start=\"4.14\" data-end=\"4.4\"> you're</span><span data-start=\"4.4\" data-end=\"4.66\"> ready,</span><span data-start=\"4.88\" data-end=\"5.06\"> click</span><span data-start=\"5.06\" data-end=\"5.36\"> Start</span><span data-start=\"5.36\" data-end=\"5.68\"> Module</span><span data-start=\"5.68\" data-end=\"6.18\"> and</span><span data-start=\"6.18\" data-end=\"6.34\"> I'll</span><span data-start=\"6.34\" data-end=\"6.68\"> explain</span><span data-start=\"6.68\" data-end=\"7.02\"> each</span><span data-start=\"7.02\" data-end=\"7.4\"> section</span><span data-start=\"7.4\" data-end=\"7.64\"> as</span><span data-start=\"7.64\" data-end=\"7.78\"> we</span><span data-start=\"7.78\" data-end=\"8\"> go.</span> </p> </div><div data-index=\"1\"> <p><span>welcoming tone</span></p><p> <span data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"0.26\"> Welcome</span><span data-start=\"0.26\" data-end=\"0.48\"> to</span><span data-start=\"0.48\" data-end=\"0.58\"> the</span><span data-start=\"0.58\" data-end=\"0.86\"> team.</span><span data-start=\"1.1\" data-end=\"1.2\"> Our</span><span data-start=\"1.2\" data-end=\"1.76\"> onboarding</span><span data-start=\"1.76\" data-end=\"2\"> syllabus</span><span data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"2.32\"> will</span><span data-start=\"2.32\" data-end=\"2.54\"> guide</span><span data-start=\"2.54\" data-end=\"2.72\"> you</span><span data-start=\"2.72\" data-end=\"2.88\"> through</span><span data-start=\"2.88\" data-end=\"3\"> the</span><span data-start=\"3\" data-end=\"3.28\"> initial</span><span data-start=\"3.28\" data-end=\"3.76\"> setup,</span><span data-start=\"4.04\" data-end=\"4.3\"> HR</span><span data-start=\"4.3\" data-end=\"4.88\"> policies,</span><span data-start=\"5.22\" data-end=\"5.52\"> and</span><span data-start=\"5.52\" data-end=\"5.62\"> an</span><span data-start=\"5.62\" data-end=\"6.08\"> introduction</span><span data-start=\"6.08\" data-end=\"6.46\"> to</span><span data-start=\"6.46\" data-end=\"6.56\"> our</span><span data-start=\"6.56\" data-end=\"6.9\"> cultural</span><span data-start=\"6.9\" data-end=\"7.32\"> values.</span><span data-start=\"7.86\" data-end=\"8.14\"> Let's</span><span data-start=\"8.14\" data-end=\"8.42\"> begin.</span> </p> </div><div data-index=\"2\"> <p><span>confident tone</span></p><p> <span data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"0.301\"> Hi</span><span data-start=\"0.301\" data-end=\"0.602\"> there.</span><span data-start=\"0.602\" data-end=\"0.904\"> I</span><span data-start=\"0.904\" data-end=\"1.205\"> noticed</span><span data-start=\"1.205\" data-end=\"1.506\"> you</span><span data-start=\"1.506\" data-end=\"1.807\"> were</span><span data-start=\"1.807\" data-end=\"2.108\"> exploring</span><span data-start=\"2.108\" data-end=\"2.409\"> our</span><span data-start=\"2.409\" data-end=\"2.711\"> enterprise</span><span data-start=\"2.711\" data-end=\"3.012\"> plans.</span><span data-start=\"3.012\" data-end=\"3.313\"> I'd</span><span data-start=\"3.313\" data-end=\"3.614\"> love</span><span data-start=\"3.614\" data-end=\"3.915\"> to</span><span data-start=\"3.915\" data-end=\"4.216\"> show</span><span data-start=\"4.216\" data-end=\"4.518\"> you</span><span data-start=\"4.518\" data-end=\"4.819\"> how</span><span data-start=\"4.819\" data-end=\"5.12\"> our</span><span data-start=\"5.12\" data-end=\"5.58\"> custom</span><span data-start=\"5.58\" data-end=\"6.04\"> solution</span><span data-start=\"6.04\" data-end=\"6.5\"> can</span><span data-start=\"6.5\" data-end=\"6.96\"> significantly</span><span data-start=\"6.96\" data-end=\"7.42\"> increase</span><span data-start=\"7.42\" data-end=\"7.88\"> your</span><span data-start=\"7.88\" data-end=\"8.34\"> conversion</span><span data-start=\"8.34\" data-end=\"8.8\"> rates.</span> </p> </div><div data-index=\"3\"> <p><span>empathetic tone</span></p><p> <span data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"0.22\"> I'm</span><span data-start=\"0.22\" data-end=\"0.42\"> so</span><span data-start=\"0.42\" data-end=\"0.8\"> sorry</span><span data-start=\"0.8\" data-end=\"0.98\"> to</span><span data-start=\"0.98\" data-end=\"1.2\"> hear</span><span data-start=\"1.2\" data-end=\"1.44\"> you</span><span data-start=\"1.44\" data-end=\"1.58\"> are</span><span data-start=\"1.58\" data-end=\"2.16\"> experiencing</span><span data-start=\"2.16\" data-end=\"2.76\"> issues</span><span data-start=\"2.76\" data-end=\"3.06\"> with</span><span data-start=\"3.06\" data-end=\"3.24\"> your</span><span data-start=\"3.24\" data-end=\"3.66\"> account.</span><span data-start=\"4.18\" data-end=\"4.62\"> Let</span><span data-start=\"4.62\" data-end=\"4.72\"> me</span><span data-start=\"4.72\" data-end=\"4.96\"> pull</span><span data-start=\"4.96\" data-end=\"5.12\"> up</span><span data-start=\"5.12\" data-end=\"5.24\"> your</span><span data-start=\"5.24\" data-end=\"5.54\"> details</span><span data-start=\"5.54\" data-end=\"5.9\"> right</span><span data-start=\"5.9\" data-end=\"6.18\"> away,</span><span data-start=\"6.52\" data-end=\"6.7\"> and</span><span data-start=\"6.7\" data-end=\"6.86\"> we</span><span data-start=\"6.86\" data-end=\"7.02\"> will</span><span data-start=\"7.02\" data-end=\"7.18\"> get</span><span data-start=\"7.18\" data-end=\"7.36\"> this</span><span data-start=\"7.36\" data-end=\"7.66\"> sorted</span><span data-start=\"7.66\" data-end=\"7.88\"> out</span><span data-start=\"7.88\" data-end=\"8.14\"> for</span><span data-start=\"8.14\" data-end=\"8.4\"> you.</span> </p> </div> </div> </div> <!-- CTA --> <div id=\"contact\"> <div><picture> <source srcset=\"/_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_Ha3xJ.avif 900w, /_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_SRo3l.avif 1400w, /_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_Z2tYAT2.avif 1916w\" type=\"image/avif\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1180px) 100vw, 1180px\"><source srcset=\"/_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_Z25OyGD.webp 900w, /_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_rrp9x.webp 1400w, /_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_28Ly16.webp 1916w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1180px) 100vw, 1180px\">  <img src=\"/_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_4Idai.png\" srcset=\"/_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_ZbNTyO.png 900w, /_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_Z1BAUGg.png 1400w, /_astro/texture.DLq98Hoe_4Idai.png 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1180px) 100vw, 1180px\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"821\"> </picture></div> <div> <h2>Run voice AI where your users are.</h2> <p>Free plan, no card. Or talk to us about running it inside your own environment.</p>  <p>Or reach us at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d6b5b9b8a2b7b5a296bab9bda3a2b9a4f8b5b9bb\"><span data-cfemail=\"e88b87869c898b9ca88487839d9c879ac68b8785\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p> </div> </div> </DIV></DIV>","content_text":"Programs & partners Turn-taking, noise suppression and speech synthesis built for ordinary processors. No GPUs. Runs in your cloud, on-prem, or on the device. Press the mic and talk. Words appear as you speak. Tap to start Drop a WAV file, or browse 16-bit WAV · any sample rate · runs on CPU Pick a voice and a language, then just talk. No sign-up. 0 GPUs in the whole pipeline ≈120 ms first audio, streaming mode ≈0.9 s to first reply, ≈1.3 s with turn detection 33 languages 10 voices, visemes included 01 · The pipelineFive stages. Four are ours. Audio goes in on the left and comes back as a voice on the right. Everything except the language model is our own CPU model. Psst Noise suppression Turno Turn-taking Conv Speech-to-text LLM Your provider Versa Speech synthesis About 0.9 s to the first word of the reply on one 4-vCPU node · See where the time goes 02 · Turn-takingTurno decides whose turn it is. The turn passes on what it hears, not on a silence timer. A “mhm” doesn’t take it. A real interruption does. 03 · NoisePsst hears the voice, not the room. The same two seconds of speech, drawn from the real audio. Drag the line to compare, or press play and watch it move. 04 · Where it runsSame models. Three places. Because nothing needs an accelerator, the pipeline goes wherever the CPU is. 05 · The voiceHear voices. instructive tone Okay, let's walk through the new dashboard interface together. Whenever you're ready, click Start Module and I'll explain each section as we go. welcoming tone Welcome to the team. Our onboarding syllabus will guide you through the initial setup, HR policies, and an introduction to our cultural values. Let's begin. confident tone Hi there. I noticed you were exploring our enterprise plans. I'd love to show you how our custom solution can significantly increase your conversion rates. empathetic tone I'm so sorry to hear you are experiencing issues with your account. Let me pull up your details right away, and we will get this sorted out for you. Run voice AI where your users are. Free plan, no card. Or talk to us about running it inside your own environment. Or reach us at [email protected]","fetched_at":"2026-09-15T18:13:38.917Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><span>Programs &amp; partners</span> <a href=\"/blog/selected-for-bsc-ai-factory\"><img src=\"/bsc_logo.png\" alt=\"Barcelona Supercomputing Center AI Factory\"></a> <a href=\"/blog/nvidia-inception-program\"><img src=\"/nvidia-inception.svg\" alt=\"NVIDIA Inception\"></a> <img src=\"/aws.svg\" alt=\"AWS\"> <img src=\"/madrid-innovation.png\" alt=\"Madrid Innovation\"> </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Programs & partners","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Turn-taking, noise suppression and speech synthesis built for ordinary processors. No GPUs. Runs in your cloud, on-prem, or on the device.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Turn-taking, noise suppression and speech synthesis built for ordinary processors.","zh":null},{"en":"No GPUs.","zh":null},{"en":"Runs in your cloud, on-prem, or on the device.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p data-stt-out=\"\"><span>Press the mic and talk. Words appear as you speak.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Press the mic and talk.","zh":null},{"en":"Words appear as you speak.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p> <span data-stt-meta=\"\">Tap to start</span> </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Tap to start","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><label data-hd-noise-drop=\"\" for=\"hd-noise-file\">   <span>Drop a WAV file, or <span>browse</span></span> <span>16-bit WAV · any sample rate · runs on CPU</span> </label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Drop a WAV file, or browse 16-bit WAV · any sample rate · runs on CPU","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p data-note=\"\">Pick a voice and a language, then just talk. No sign-up.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Pick a voice and a language, then just talk.","zh":null},{"en":"No sign-up.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"></span><span data-to=\"0\" data-decimals=\"0\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">0</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">GPUs</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">in the whole pipeline</span> </p>","sentences":[{"en":"0 GPUs in the whole pipeline","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">≈</span><span data-to=\"120\" data-decimals=\"0\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">120</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">ms</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">first audio, streaming mode</span> </p>","sentences":[{"en":"≈120 ms first audio, streaming mode","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">≈</span><span data-to=\"0.9\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">0.9</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">s</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">to first reply, ≈1.3 s with turn detection</span> </p>","sentences":[{"en":"≈0.9 s to first reply, ≈1.3 s with turn detection","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\"></span><span data-to=\"33\" data-decimals=\"0\" data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">33</span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">languages</span></span> <span data-astro-cid-hg2zf7ki=\"\">10 voices, visemes included</span> </p>","sentences":[{"en":"33 languages 10 voices, visemes included","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>01 · The pipeline</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"01 · The pipeline","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Five stages. Four are ours.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Five stages.","zh":null},{"en":"Four are ours.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Audio goes in on the left and comes back as a voice on the right. Everything except the language model is our own CPU model.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Audio goes in on the left and comes back as a voice on the right.","zh":null},{"en":"Everything except the language model is our own CPU model.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li data-i=\"0\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Psst</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Noise suppression</span> </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Psst Noise suppression","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li data-i=\"1\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Turno</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Turn-taking</span> </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Turno Turn-taking","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li data-i=\"2\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Conv</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Speech-to-text</span> </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Conv Speech-to-text","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li data-i=\"3\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">LLM</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Your provider</span> </li>","sentences":[{"en":"LLM Your provider","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li data-i=\"4\" data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\"></span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Versa</span> <span data-astro-cid-veyrnipl=\"\">Speech synthesis</span> </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Versa Speech synthesis","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>About 0.9 s to the first word of the reply on one 4-vCPU node · <a href=\"/benchmarks\">See where the time goes </a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"About 0.9 s to the first word of the reply on one 4-vCPU node · See where the time goes","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>02 · Turn-taking</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"02 · Turn-taking","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Turno decides whose turn it is.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Turno decides whose turn it is.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>The turn passes on what it hears, not on a silence timer. A “mhm” doesn’t take it. A real interruption does.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The turn passes on what it hears, not on a silence timer.","zh":null},{"en":"A “mhm” doesn’t take it.","zh":null},{"en":"A real interruption does.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>03 · Noise</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h2>Psst hears the voice, not the room.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Psst hears the voice, not the room.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>The same two seconds of speech, drawn from the real audio. Drag the line to compare, or press play and watch it move.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The same two seconds of speech, drawn from the real audio.","zh":null},{"en":"Drag the line to compare, or press play and watch it move.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>04 · Where it runs</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"04 · Where it runs","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Same models. Three places.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Same models.","zh":null},{"en":"Three places.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Because nothing needs an accelerator, the pipeline goes wherever the CPU is.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Because nothing needs an accelerator, the pipeline goes wherever the CPU is.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>05 · The voice</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"05 · The voice","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Hear voices.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Hear voices.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>instructive tone</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"instructive tone","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p> <span data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"0.34\"> Okay,</span><span data-start=\"0.52\" data-end=\"0.72\"> let's</span><span data-start=\"0.72\" data-end=\"0.9\"> walk</span><span data-start=\"0.9\" data-end=\"1.14\"> through</span><spa